        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-98_47489_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><b><em>Schedule Page: 278   Line No.: 1   Column: a</em></b></span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Pursuant to guidance provided in Docket No. AI07-1-000 issued on March 29, 2007.</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><br /></span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-99_47493_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p><b><em><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Schedule Page: 278 Line No.: 2 Column: a</span></span></em></b></p><p style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Pursuant to Section 23.2(A) of the General Terms and Conditions of Trunkline's FERC Gas Tariff, Fourth Revised Volume No. 1, Docket No. RP24-1090-000 filed on September 27, 2024 and <span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); display: inline !important; float: none">Docket No. RP25-1185-000 filed on September 30, 2025.</span></span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><br /></span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-171_47488_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p><b><em><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Schedule Page: 278      Line No.: 3      Column: a</span></span></em></b></p><p><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Pursuant to Section 22 of the General Terms and Conditions of Trunkline's FERC Gas Tariff, Fourth Revised Volume No. 1, Docket No. RP24-1109-000, as approved by FERC's order issued on October 23, 2024, <span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); display: inline !important; float: none">Docket No. RP25-635-000, as approved by <span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); display: inline !important; float: none"><span> </span>FERC's o</span>rder issued on March 18, 2025, and <span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); display: inline !important; float: none">Docket No. RP25-1184-000, as approved by <span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); display: inline !important; float: none"><span> </span>FERC's o</span>rder issued on October 16, 2025.</span></span></span></span></p><p><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); display: inline !important; float: none"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); display: inline !important; float: none"><br /></span></span></span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-193_47487_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium"><b style="font-weight: bold"><em><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Schedule Page: 218 Line No.: 5 Column: f</span></span></em></b><br /></p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">The reported rate is a calculated cost &amp; revenue study rate from Trunkline's last rate case proceeding Docket No. RP17-366-000.</span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
