        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-566_47491_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif"><em><b>Schedule Page: 102 Line No.: 3 Column: d</b></em></span><br /></span></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Energy Transfer Interstate Holdings, LLC has a 99% limited partner interest in Panhandle Eastern Pipe Line Company, LP and a 100% membership interest in Southern Union Panhandle LLC. Southern Union Panhandle LLC has a 1% general partner interest in Panhandle Eastern Pipe Line Company, LP.</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><br /></span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1090_47497_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium"><b style="font-weight: bold"><em><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Schedule Page: 350 Line No.: 1 Column: e</span></span></em></b></p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Account 186, Miscellaneous deferred debits was used to record deferred charges for regulatory commission expense. This footnote applies to columns (e), (i) and (l), lines 1 and 2.</span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1146_47494_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-family: Roboto"><b style="font-weight: bold"><em><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Schedule Page: 220 Line No.: 5 Column: f</span></span></em></b></p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-family: Roboto"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Current gas represents gas that will be utilized within a twelve-month period.</span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1198_47499_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-family: Roboto"><b style="font-weight: bold"><em><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Schedule Page: 118 Line No.: 14 Column: c</span></span></em></b></p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-family: Roboto"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Trunkline Gas Company, LLC, as a limited liability company, records member's equity in Other Paid-In Capital.</span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-family: Roboto"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Statement of Retained Earnings (unaudited)</span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1298_47498_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium"><b style="font-weight: bold"><em><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Schedule Page: 220 Line No.: 5 Column: i</span></span></em></b></p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Trunkline utilizes the inventory method to account for the gas.</span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1688_47500_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><b style="font-weight: bold"><em>Schedule Page: 521 Line No.: 7 Column: f</em></b></span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium"><em style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal"><b style="font-weight: bold"><em style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 16px; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: 700"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; text-decoration: inherit; display: inline !important">The basis for valuing the gas reported in columns (f), (g) and (h) is the weighted average rate for system gas.</span></em></b></em></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1868_47495_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><b style="font-weight: bold"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Schedule Page: 219 L</span><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">ine No.: 17.1 Column: c</span></b></span></p><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="453" class="e-rte-table-border e-rte-paste-table" style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); margin-bottom: 10px; width: 453px"><tr style="height: 24.7525%"><td height="20" width="353" class="" style="padding: 0; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; height: 15pt; width: 656.354px"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Other (debit) or credit items</span></span></td><td width="100" class="" style="text-align: center; border-bottom: 0.5pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); padding: 0; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; width: 198.188px"><span> <span> </span></span><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Amount</span></span><span> </span></td></tr><tr style="height: 24.7525%"><td height="20" class="" style="padding: 0; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; height: 15pt; width: 656.354px"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Vehicle transfer</span></span><span>  </span></td><td style="text-align: right; padding: 0; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; width: 198.188px"><span style="font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt"> <span> </span></span><span style="font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">$</span></span><span style="font-family: Calibri, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 11pt">        </span></span><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 16px">21,918</span></span></td></tr><tr style="height: 24.7525%"><td height="20" class="" style="padding: 0; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; height: 15pt; width: 656.354px"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Other</span></span></td><td class="" style="text-align: right; border-bottom: 0.5pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); padding: 0; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; width: 198.188px"><span>              <span> </span></span><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">1,417</span></span></td></tr><tr style="height: 24.7525%"><td height="19" class="" style="padding: 0; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; height: 14.25pt; width: 656.354px"><br /></td><td class="" style="text-align: right; padding: 0; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap; width: 198.188px"><span> <span> </span></span><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">$</span></span><span>       <span> </span></span><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">23,335</span></span></td></tr></table></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1871_47509_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium"><b style="font-weight: bold"><em><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Schedule Page: 338 Line No.: 4 Column: b</span></span></em></b></p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Depreciation Plant Basis reflects balance as of 12/31/2025. This footnote also applies to lines 7, 8 and 9.</span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1875_47490_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium"><b style="font-weight: bold"><em><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Schedule Page: 262 Line No.: 5 Column: i</span></span></em></b></p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px">Reversals of prior period accruals. This footnote also applies to column (i), lines 7, 11, 12, and 33.</span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1896_47505_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-size: medium; color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1); font-family: Roboto"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><b style="font-weight: bold"><em>Schedule Page: 336 Line No.: 5 Column: b</em></b></span></span></p><p style="margin: 0; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-size: medium; color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1); font-family: Roboto"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Underground storage plant is depreciated on a composite allocation basis, per assigned FERC rates.</span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1898_47492_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-size: medium; color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1); font-family: Roboto"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><b style="font-weight: bold"><em>Schedule Page: 336 Line No.: 10 Column: b</em></b></span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-size: medium; color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1); font-family: Roboto"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">General plant is depreciated on a straight line basis, per assigned FERC rates.</span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-2013_47496_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto"><b style="font-weight: bold; color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)"><em><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Schedule Page: 120 Line No.: 16.1 Column: b</span></span></em></b></p><p><img src="data:image/gif;base64," class="e-rte-image e-imginline" width="auto" height="auto" style="min-width: 0; max-width: 1265px; min-height: 0" alt="" /> </p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-3072_47514_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)"><b style="font-weight: bold"><em><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Schedule Page: 313 Line No.: 2 Column: c</span></span></em></b></p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">The volumes include discounted reservation contract quantities and commodity transactions.</span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-3073_47515_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium"><b style="font-weight: bold"><em><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Schedule Page: 313 Line No.: 2 Column: e</span></span></em></b></p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">The volumes include negotiated reservation contract quantities and commodity transactions.</span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-3180_47512_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><em><b style="font-weight: bold">Schedule Page: 520 Line No.: 12 Column: c</b></em></span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; float: none; display: inline !important">Other gas withdrawn from storage represents withdrawals of system balancing gas. This footnote also applies to line 12, column (d).</span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-3191_47507_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px"><em style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: initial; text-align: inherit; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><b style="font-weight: bold">Schedule Page: 520 Line No.:29.1 Column: d</b></em></p><p style="margin: 0"><img src="data:image/gif;base64," class="e-rte-image e-imginline" width="auto" height="auto" style="min-width: 0; max-width: 895px; min-height: 0" alt="" />  </p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-3192_47504_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium"><b style="font-weight: bold"><em><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Schedule Page: 519 Line No.: 1 Column: c</span></span></em></b></p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">All volumes are in Dth at 14.73 psia and 60 degrees Fahrenheit.</span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-3202_47510_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium"><b style="font-weight: bold"><em><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Schedule Page: 520 Line No.: 20 Column: c</span></span></em></b></p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">For the purpose of the Annual Charge Adjustment ("ACA") calculation, the throughput volume is<span> </span></span></span>1,022,181,796<span> </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: initial">Dth as represented on line 20. No additional volumes are needed to calculate the total volumes eligible for the ACA surcharge.</span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-3205_47511_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><em><b style="font-weight: bold">Schedule Page: 520 Line No.: 27 Column: c</b></em></span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Other gas delivered to storage represents injections of system balancing gas.<span> </span></span><span><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; float: none; display: inline !important">This footnote also applies to line 27, column (d).</span></span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-3266_47513_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium"><b style="font-weight: bold; color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal"><em>Schedule Page: 521 Line No.: 7 Column: e</em></b></p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium"><b style="font-weight: bold; color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal"><em><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span>The allocation is derived from the throughput volume of each contract within the billing system. A path to path calculation of the rate utilized</span></span></span><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); float: none; display: inline !important"><span><span> <span> </span></span></span></span><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span>within the contract billing is determined and a percentage for recourse rate, discount rate and negotiated rate is derived based on the rate</span></span></span><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); float: none; display: inline !important"><span><span> <span> </span></span></span></span><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span>charged within the paths.</span></span></span></em></b></p><p style="margin: 0; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)"><span style="font-size: 12pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span>This footnote also applies to column (e), lines 14, 22, 30, 37, 51 and 65.</span></span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-3491_47508_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium"><b style="font-weight: bold; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal"><em><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Schedule Page: 514 Line No.: 8 Column: e</span></span></em></b><br /></p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; float: none; display: inline !important">Trunkline operates 243.6 miles of transmission pipeline in Indiana, of which 243.4 miles is owned by Trunkline and 0.2 miles is owned by Panhandle Eastern Pipe Line Company, LP.</span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-3513_47501_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium"><b style="font-weight: bold"><em><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Schedule Page: 338 Line No.: 8 Column: c</span></span></em></b></p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">The applied depreciation rates for General Plant range from 3.5% to 20%.</span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-3514_47502_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)"><b style="font-weight: bold"><em><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Schedule Page: 338 Line No.: 7 Column: c</span></span></em></b></p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">The applied depreciation rates for Transmission Plant onshore range from 0.35% to 3.5%.</span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-3515_47503_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium"><b style="font-weight: bold"><em><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">Schedule Page: 338 Line No.: 9 Column: c</span></span></em></b></p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt">The applied depreciation rates for Intangibles range from 1.62% to 20%.</span></span></p></div></link:footnote>
    </link:footnoteLink>
